{"3225320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ocean Survivors", "steam_appid": 3225320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ocean Survivors is a bite-sized, pirate-themed survivors-like. It features minimalistic gameplay, including score-attack and roguelite elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off hordes of enemies and level up your ship. The more you level up, the bigger your advantage against other pirates is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive a 15-minute run?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/30dc7ef80e8dcf7568dc23e63a918377.avif?t=1787130135\" width=1200 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/a704439c98fe46569aabf7a6eaa9a552.webp?t=1787130135\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/a704439c98fe46569aabf7a6eaa9a552.poster.webp?t=1787130135\" class=\"bb_img\" width=617 height=280 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Endless Grinding</strong>: This game is made to be completed within ~3 hours.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Builds Every Run:</strong> Every run starts from scratch. Adapt to the choices you are given, combine powerful weapons, and find the ultimate build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Over Meta-Progression:</strong> Aside from unlocking new abilities, there are no permanent stat boosts. Your survival depends on your tactical upgrades, skills, and a little bit of luck.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/911d2d3cd40be6d404e1c5268acb556c.avif?t=1787130135\" width=1200 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/37e2a05da717a27aeaa2d0a0deffbeab.poster.avif?t=1787130135\" width=618 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/37e2a05da717a27aeaa2d0a0deffbeab.webm?t=1787130135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/37e2a05da717a27aeaa2d0a0deffbeab.mp4?t=1787130135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increase Your Destructive Power</strong>: Level up during combat to expand your arsenal with burst-firing cannons, overwhelming power-ups, and unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Bullet Hell:</strong> Dodge incoming cannon fire and navigate around enemy fleets as the intensity ramps up.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/c06a5c651ceb22add79779f46a0824ec.avif?t=1787130135\" width=1200 height=127 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/0c0c1562b60c2a2182fe14e09982c89f.webp?t=1787130135\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/0c0c1562b60c2a2182fe14e09982c89f.poster.webp?t=1787130135\" class=\"bb_img\" width=617 height=280 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunder and Loot:</strong> Pick up gold from sunken enemy ships to increase your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Compete directly against other players. Climb the ranks, secure the #1 spot, and prove you are the ultimate pirate captain!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you climb the ranks?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ocean Survivors is a bite-sized, pirate-themed survivors-like. It features minimalistic gameplay, including score-attack and roguelite elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off hordes of enemies and level up your ship. The more you level up, the bigger your advantage against other pirates is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive a 15-minute run?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/30dc7ef80e8dcf7568dc23e63a918377.avif?t=1787130135\" width=1200 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/a704439c98fe46569aabf7a6eaa9a552.webp?t=1787130135\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/a704439c98fe46569aabf7a6eaa9a552.poster.webp?t=1787130135\" class=\"bb_img\" width=617 height=280 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Endless Grinding</strong>: This game is made to be completed within ~3 hours.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Builds Every Run:</strong> Every run starts from scratch. Adapt to the choices you are given, combine powerful weapons, and find the ultimate build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Over Meta-Progression:</strong> Aside from unlocking new abilities, there are no permanent stat boosts. Your survival depends on your tactical upgrades, skills, and a little bit of luck.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/911d2d3cd40be6d404e1c5268acb556c.avif?t=1787130135\" width=1200 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/37e2a05da717a27aeaa2d0a0deffbeab.poster.avif?t=1787130135\" width=618 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/37e2a05da717a27aeaa2d0a0deffbeab.webm?t=1787130135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/37e2a05da717a27aeaa2d0a0deffbeab.mp4?t=1787130135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increase Your Destructive Power</strong>: Level up during combat to expand your arsenal with burst-firing cannons, overwhelming power-ups, and unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Bullet Hell:</strong> Dodge incoming cannon fire and navigate around enemy fleets as the intensity ramps up.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225320/extras/c06a5c651ceb22add79779f46a0824ec.avif?t=1787130135\" width=1200 height=127 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"